# Code owners for UniZ.
#
# Every pull request to a protected branch (main) requires an approving review
# from a code owner listed here before it can be merged. Combined with branch
# protection, this means: contributors open PRs and request review; only after a
# code owner approves can the PR be merged, and only the maintainers with push
# access to `main` can perform the merge.
#
# To grant someone review/merge authority in the future:
#   1. Add their GitHub username on the line below (space-separated), e.g.
#        *       @sreecharan-desu @new-maintainer
#   2. Add the same username to the branch protection "restrict who can push"
#      list for `main` (Settings → Branches, or see docs/ops/github-governance.md).
#
# Path-specific owners can be added below the catch-all if needed, e.g.
#   /apps/uniz-academics/   @some-academics-owner

*       @sreecharan-desu
